---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /documents/
title: Documents
description: Public records about the data center at 4405 US Route 1 in South Brunswick, NJ.
---
<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Documents</h1>
    <p class="lede">Public records about the project: site plans, applications, resolutions, permits and reports, most obtained through Open Public Records Act (OPRA) requests.</p>
    <p class="muted">We remove residents' personal details before publishing. Have a document we should add? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap section">
  {% if documents and documents.length %}
  <ul class="docs">
    {% for d in documents | newestFirst %}
    <li class="doc">
      <div class="doc-main">
        <p class="doc-meta"><span class="doc-type">{{ d.type }}</span>{% if d.date %} · {{ d.date | readableDate }}{% endif %}</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ d.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ d.title }}</a></h2>
        {% if d.description %}<p>{{ d.description }}</p>{% endif %}
        {% if d.obtained %}<p class="muted small">Source: {{ d.obtained }}</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <a class="btn small" href="{{ d.url }}" rel="noopener">PDF{% if d.size %} · {{ d.size }}{% endif %}</a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <div class="card">
    <h2 class="h3">Documents are on the way</h2>
    <p>We're requesting the site plans, Planning Board records and permit files. They'll be posted here as they arrive.</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>
